    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "√︀\uD835\uDC5B/\uD835\uDC51. We see in Figure 1a that standard base-point choices on CIFAR10 are significantly below the vertical line. It is the goal of future work to determine if the dimension of the tangent space of CIFAR10 of \uD835\uDC5B = 144 or the parameter of the Gaussian base-point impacts the tangential alignment of IG on CIFAR10."
